UID:69a740e88966a226aae0c51f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This program teaches participants how to prepare a proper Milk
  Boba. All required ingredients will be set out in front of each person\, 
 who will mix them with ice cubes to create a milk-based Boba. They will th
 en move on to preparing and mixing ingredients for the Milk Boba\, which w
 ill be in a proper take-home lidded cup with a large straw.\n*contains dai
 ry\nIngredients: Sugar\, brown sugar\, molasses\, milk\, tapioca pearls\, 
 canned whipping cream.\n"Food allergy notice: Please be aware that food wi
 ll be used in this program. Certain food ingredients may cause allergic re
 actions in some people."\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal inf
 ormation on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the
  Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The informatio
 n will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and eval
 uation. Questions about how the library handles your information can be di
 rected to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yo
 nge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Cliffcrest
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69a740e88966a226aae0c51f
