DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260707T150000
UID:6a2d7440f56bd86e00b68e36@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Have fun learning a new instrument - the ukulele! This worksho
 p\, led by music instructor Meghan Gallant\, will cover fundamentals of uk
 ulele playing: the parts of a ukulele\, tuning\, strumming patterns\, and 
 some basic chords. By the end of this class\, you'll have learned the skil
 ls you need to start playing your first songs on the ukulele!\nBeginner fr
 iendly\, no previous experience is necessary. Participants are welcome to 
 bring their own ukulele\, or to use one provided.\nThis program is for kid
 s age 7-12\n.\n10 spots are available. Space is limited.
LOCATION:High Park\, Program Room
