UID:69f4ec10213814b1b525b190@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Gain hands-on experience on how robots use their sensors to wo
 rk using Scribbler Robots\, then test how their programming allows these r
 obots to respond to their environments. This workshop starts by showing wh
 y and how NASA is using robots to explore Mars and ends with showing how p
 rogramming allows robots and non-intended devices to actually work togethe
 r.
