DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260711T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260711T160000
UID:6a219ddcc6a1dc3d00d85cc6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Presenting the film version of\nThe Secret Garden\n\, publish
 ed in 1911 by Frances Hodgson Burnett\, a British/American beloved author
  of children's literature. This classic novel centers on the physical and
  emotional transformation of two sickly\, neglected children through the h
 ealing power of nature and friendship. This is the 2020 Disney version of 
 the film starring Colin Firth.\nEveryone is welcome to this inclusive scre
 ening.\nDrop-in! No registration required.
LOCATION:Hillcrest\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a219ddcc6a1dc3d00d85cc6
